        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ms\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Soalan dan Jawapan - Penentangan Malayan Union</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  .toolbar {\n    height: 34px;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #d9d9d9;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 0 14px;\n    color: #6b6b6b;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  .toolbar .center-icons span { margin: 0 10px; }\n  .toolbar .right-icons span { margin: 0 8px; }\n  .page {\n    max-width: 560px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 14px 22px 40px 22px;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin: 4px 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  .qrow {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  .qnum {\n    width: 34px;\n    flex: 0 0 34px;\n  }\n  .qtext { flex: 1; }\n  .highlight { background: #fce9b0; }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 150px;\n    height: 78px;\n    margin: 10px auto 8px auto;\n    border: 1px solid #555;\n    background: #e8e8e8;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #333;\n    padding: 2px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .caption-q {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 6px 0 14px 0;\n  }\n  .ans-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .code {\n    width: 40px;\n    flex: 0 0 40px;\n    font-weight: normal;\n  }\n  .code.bold { font-weight: bold; }\n  .ans-text { flex: 1; }\n  .ans-text.bold { font-weight: bold; }\n  .group { margin-top: 6px; }\n  .homebar {\n    width: 130px;\n    height: 5px;\n    background: #111;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    margin: 20px auto 8px auto;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"toolbar\">\n  <span></span>\n  <span class=\"center-icons\">\n    <span>Aa</span><span>&#9776;</span><span>&#9638;</span><span>&#128247;</span>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"right-icons\">\n    <span>&#8683;</span><span>&#9432;</span><span>&#9786;</span><span>&#9998;</span>\n  </span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">Soalan</div>\n\n  <div class=\"qrow\">\n    <div class=\"qnum\">1.</div>\n    <div class=\"qtext\">Senaraikan cara-cara penentangan orang Melayu terhadap Malayan Union. [3m] (Perak)</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"qrow\">\n    <div class=\"qnum\">2.</div>\n    <div class=\"qtext\"><span class=\"highlight\">Jelaskan reaksi penduduk tempatan terhadap pembentukan Malayan Union.[6 m] (SBP)</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"qrow\">\n    <div class=\"qnum\">3.</div>\n    <div class=\"qtext\">Gambar memaparkan penentangan rakyat tempatan terhadap Malayan Union.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: centered — gambar hitam putih perhimpunan orang ramai dengan sepanduk / kain rentang]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"caption-q\">Bagaimanakah mereka menzahirkan penentangan tersebut? [6m](Perak)</div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">Jawapan</div>\n\n  <div class=\"ans-row\">\n    <div class=\"code bold\">F1</div>\n    <div class=\"ans-text bold\">Membawa kes Malayan Union ke Mahkamah Tinggi England</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ans-row\">\n    <div class=\"code\">H1a</div>\n    <div class=\"ans-text\">Persidangan Raja-raja Melayu di Istana Iskandariah Kuala Kangsar</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ans-row\">\n    <div class=\"code\">H1b</div>\n    <div class=\"ans-text\">Sultan Perak, Sultan Kedah dan Sultan Johor akan berangkat ke England sekiranya kehadiran mereka diperlukan di mahkamah tersebut.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ans-row group\">\n    <div class=\"code bold\">F2</div>\n    <div class=\"ans-text bold\">Menghantar surat bantahan ke London</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ans-row\">\n    <div class=\"code\">H2a</div>\n    <div class=\"ans-text\">Sultan Kedah, Perak dan Johor mengutus surat bantahan kepada Setiausaha Tanah Jajahan British, George Henry Hall</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ans-row\">\n    <div class=\"code\">H2b</div>\n    <div class=\"ans-text\">Tuanku Syed Putra Jamalullail mengirim telegram kepada kerajaan British di London.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ans-row group\">\n    <div class=\"code bold\">F3</div>\n    <div class=\"ans-text bold\">Menyokong Kongres Melayu</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ans-row\">\n    <div class=\"code\">H3</div>\n    <div class=\"ans-text\">Sultan Hisamuddin Alam Shah ibni Almarhum Sultan Alauddin Sulaiman Shah menderma sebanyak $15 ribu kepada Persatuan Melayu Selangor.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ans-row group\">\n    <div class=\"code bold\">F4</div>\n    <div class=\"ans-text bold\">Permaisuri Perak memimpin Gerakan menentang Malayan Union</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ans-row\">\n    <div class=\"code\">H4</div>\n    <div class=\"ans-text\">Tuanku Permaisuri Perak, Raja Perempuan Kelsom mengetuai barisan hadapan perarakan.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ans-row group\">\n    <div class=\"code bold\">F5</div>\n    <div class=\"ans-text bold\">Memulau upacara pelantikan Gabenor Malayan Union</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ans-row\">\n    <div class=\"code\">H5</div>\n    <div class=\"ans-text\">Dato' Onn Jaafar mempersembahkan resolusi Kongres Melayu, memohon Raja-raja Melayu supaya bersama-sama dengan rakyat memboikot upacara pelantikan Gabenor Malayan Union.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ans-row group\">\n    <div class=\"code bold\">F6</div>\n    <div class=\"ans-text bold\">Menggunakan akhbar</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ans-row\">\n    <div class=\"code\">H6a</div>\n    <div class=\"ans-text\">menyeru orang Melayu mengadakan perhimpunan besar besaran.</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ans-row\">\n    <div class=\"code\">H6b</div>\n    <div class=\"ans-text\">sentiasa melaporkan perkembangan berita penentangan orang Melayu.</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ans-row\">\n    <div class=\"code\">C6</div>\n    <div class=\"ans-text\">Utusan Melayu, Majlis, Warta Negara</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"homebar\"></div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
